t":"We trained each model for 50 epochs with a batch size of 32.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"calib_009_s4","report_id":"calib_009","text":"Figure 1 shows the validation accuracy during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"calib_009_s5","report_id":"calib_009","text":"From epoch 16 to epoch 20, the validation accuracy of MobileNet improves by a relative 7.9%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"calib_009_s6","report_id":"calib_009","text":"As shown in Figure 1, MobileNet outperforms EfficientNet by 12 percentage points at epoch 6.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"calib_009_s7","report_id":"calib_009","text":"Figure 2 shows the training loss.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"calib_009_s8","report_id":"calib_009","text":"At epoch 12, the loss of GRU is 0.994.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"calib_009_s9","report_id":"calib_009","text":"At epoch 8, the loss of GRU is 0.387.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"calib_009_s10","report_id":"calib_009","text":"At epoch 16, the loss of GRU is","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"calib_009_s11","report_id":"calib_009","text":"0.506.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"calib_009_s12","report_id":"calib_009","text":"Figure 3 shows the test accuracy of GRU by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"calib_009_s13","report_id":"calib_009","text":"On AG News, GRU obtains a test accuracy of 100.6%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"calib_009_s14","report_id":"calib_009","text":"On CIFAR-10, GRU obtains a test accuracy of 80.2% (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"calib_009_s15","report_id":"calib_009","text":"GRU reaches 92.6% test accuracy on AG News (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"calib_009_s16","report_id":"calib_009","text":"On Tiny-ImageNet, Naive Bayes obtains an accuracy of 85.6%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"calib_009_s17","report_id":"calib_009","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"}]}